    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is discontinuous as it is an non-integral value.</p>",
